{"sourceUrl":"https://glxy.cumtb.edu.cn/info/1107/12048.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:15.991807+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://glxy.cumtb.edu.cn/info/1107/12048.htm","html":"<div> <div><div>\n<p><strong><span>管理学院</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>关于</span></strong><strong><span>做好</span></strong><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span>年接收推免生工作的通知</span></strong></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><span>为做好我</span><span>院</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生工作，现将推免生报名及</span><span>复试录取相关工作安排如下。</span></p><p><strong><span>一、推免</span></strong><strong><span>生</span></strong><strong><span>预报名工作安排</span></strong></p><p><span><span>我校</span><span>202</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>年推免预报名系统在</span><span>9月</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>日</span><span>-9月</span></span><span>18</span><span>日向考生开放，预报考生面试时间及方式由报考导师决定，</span><strong><span>请考生务必在系统报名时准确填写申请导师</span></strong><span>。</span><span>考生报名后</span><span>需</span><span>填写</span><strong><span><span><span>《</span><span>202</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年中国矿业大学（北京）管理学院硕士复试生简况表》</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>附件</span><span>1</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><span>，连同个人相关成绩资料</span><span>及证明材料</span><span>发送</span><span>至报考</span><span>导师</span><span>邮箱</span><span>。</span><strong><span><span><span>我院</span><span>202</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年导师</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>招生计划及联系邮箱</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>见《</span><span>202</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年管理学院研究生招生计划》</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>附件</span><span>2</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><span><span>。预报考生的面试工作将于</span><span>202</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span><span>9月2</span></span><span>1</span><span>日前全部完成。</span></p><p><strong><span>二、推免</span></strong><strong><span>生</span></strong><strong><span>接收工作安排</span></strong></p><p><span>根据</span><span>“中国研究生招生信息网”（简称研招网）推免服务系统正式开放</span><span>时间安排</span><span>，考生</span><span>在研招网</span><span>正式填报推免志愿。</span><span>请预报名复试合格的考生及时在研招网系统填报，</span><strong><span><span>并及时回复学院发送的复试及待录取通知。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span>三、未参加推免预报面试考生的接收工作安排</span></strong></p><p><span>在研招网推免服务系统上报考我</span><span>院</span><span>且未进行预报名面试的申请考生，我院根据预报名录取情况，将于</span><span>后续</span><span>组织面试，具体情况另行通知。</span></p><p><strong><span>四</span></strong><strong><span>、其他工作</span></strong></p><p><span>其他工作要求</span><span>按照</span><span>《中国矿业大学（北京）</span><span>关于做好</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年接收推</span><span>免</span><span>生工作</span><span>的通知</span><span>》执行。</span></p><p><span>如有问题，可通过电话和邮件与学院联系咨询。</span></p><p><span>联系方式：</span><span><span>王老师（学硕）</span>  <span>010-62331949</span></span></p><p><span>          <span>凌老师（专硕）</span>  <span>010-62339311</span></span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:cumtbglyjs@163.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>cumtbglyjs@163.com</span></span></a></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span><span>附件</span><span>1</span></span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><span><span>《</span><span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span>年中国矿业大学（北京）管理学院硕士复试生简况表》</span></p><p><strong><span><span>附件</span><span>2</span></span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><span><span>《</span><span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span>年管理学院研究生招生计划》</span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div></div>","textSha256":"ff34c664bd1bff3cfb239f155041c9e00c7e512aa77538ebd143e294eca64144","textLength":657,"sourceSha256":"0557619b810c76f05f7bf2f18229baaae9dc742632d17278a24a6e16cc392a5b","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1：2026年中国矿业大学（北京）管理学院硕士复试生简况表.doc","url":"https://glxy.cumtb.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1401762021&wbfileid=9F3DDE88AA46D727B7DD2763ADA18DFA"},{"name":"附件2：2026年管理学院研究生招生计划-（学硕+专硕）(推免公示版本).xls","url":"https://glxy.cumtb.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1401762021&wbfileid=AB4961C14FD2D0E45C57D545544B2466"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b936e85150ec2e7974f9","title":"2025年中国矿业大学（北京）管理学院关于做好2026年接收推免生工作的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:15.991807+00:00"}
